# plain-debris: from the menu, load the saved game setup/plain-debris writes (a new character
# with a scroll of Light of quality 1 in the pack's first slot); turn right to face the wall,
# drag the scroll out of the pack with the right button into the view, which throws it at the
# wall and breaks it; look down three times and at the pile of debris it leaves; drag the debris
# into the pack's first slot with the right button and use it there twice (the left button).
# With the fix the debris casts nothing. Without it (the original, the same recording with its
# enhancements chunk naming skip-intro alone) each use casts Light: the view brightens and the
# spell's icon shows beside the compass
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
7000 down d            # turn right, to face the wall
7500 up d
9000 move 250 92       # the scroll, the pack's first slot
9300 mdown 250 92 right
9600 move 220 85
9900 move 180 78
10200 move 155 75      # into the view: thrown at the wall, which breaks it
10500 mup 155 75 right
13000 key 1            # look down, three times
13800 key 1
14600 key 1
16000 move 150 89      # the debris at the foot of the wall: "You see a pile of debris"
16300 mdown 150 89 right
16500 mup 150 89 right
18000 move 150 89      # the debris, dragged into the pack's first slot
18300 mdown 150 89 right
18600 move 200 90
18900 move 250 92
19200 mup 250 92 right
21000 mdown 250 92 left    # used, twice
21200 mup 250 92 left
23000 mdown 250 92 left
23200 mup 250 92 left
25000 move 160 100
